    description: "is_utility_file matches any path component named dev as utility. In halo2, src/dev/gates.rs contains MockProver (core production code), not developer tooling. Fix: skip dev match when it appears after a source root (src/, lib/, app/). This caused rslice.0.prod.json to return 0 nodes for halo2."  # 953f
